> [We][ build][ our][ students][ up][ only][ to][ encourage][ them][ to][ flee][.][ Why][?][
][Comb][ining][ advertising][ campaigns][ handled][ by][ pros][ along][ with][ play][ on][ the][ editorial][ side][ of][ reputable][ media][ outlets][ gets][ a][ business][ noticed][ by][ potential][ customers][ who][ won][�][�][t][ be][ concerned][ about][ the][ ver][acity][ of][ claims][.][
