> [If][ you][ are][ interested][ in][ knowing][ more][ about][ New][ Life][ Community][ Church][ or][ becoming][ a][ member][,][ we][ invite][ you][ to][ join][ us][ April][ 15][ at][ 10][:][30][am][ in][ the][ Meeting][ Room][ for][ our][ Starting][ Points][ class][.][ This][ class][ will][ provide][ a][ deeper][ look][ at][ our][ beliefs][,][ our][ history][,][ and][ our][ ministries][.][
